    <statement><p>Let <me>f(x) = 7\sin^{-1}\mathopen{}\left(x^{3}\right)</me></p>
<p><m>f'( x ) =</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>NOTE:  The webwork system will accept <m>\arcsin(x)</m> or <m>\sin^{-1}(x)</m>  as the inverse of <m>\sin (x)</m>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>7\frac{1}{\sqrt{1-\left(x^{3}\right)^{2}}}\cdot 3x^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
